  "design": {
    "idea": "Split-Chasm Gale Transept: set the buoyant dandelion seed orb on the western launch pad in calm SUN, then spin WIND so the east gale wakes the bounce bloom and carries the seed across the 8-tile abyss onto the eastern plate, extending the bridge to r7 and optional r10!",
